{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_sleach_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sleach_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鬢旁的花",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sleach_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c630c4b60f7f612c8f180192fd687cef7a66277dd9ad572a28dd5a0df65ebd68",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......這麼多人都來看我出旗嗎？可千萬不能出差錯啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "不行，得再確認一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "旗子嶄新平整，沒問題。服裝整潔筆挺，沒問題。還有佩劍和靴子......嗯，擦得很乾淨，也沒有問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "哦，對了，還有頭髮！還好還好，都沒亂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "剛剛風吹得那麼猛......昨天花了一整天來保養頭髮，在這地方凸槌不就什麼都白費了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "升旗儀式現在開始，全體肅立！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "出旗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "正步走過廣場，她感受到眾人的目光都集中在自己身上，於是將脊背挺得更加筆直。\n將旗幟掛在旗繩上，捏起旗子的一角，她開始等待訊號。\n三、二、一，鼓號聲終於停息，她迅速將旗尾拋向空中，任它在晨風中舒展。隨後，她聽到腦後響起了久久不息的掌聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深吸一口氣，她將身體繃得更緊也更直，但嘴角卻抑制不住地露出了笑意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "維爾，一共是七箱藥品，都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "辛苦你跑這趟，簡妮......可我們當時付給商隊的是二十箱的錢啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "唉......商隊裡的人翻遍了貨艙，只找出了這七箱，再沒有更多的了。而且......剩餘的錢他們也不想還給我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "但價格不是我們一早就定好的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "商隊來時因為穿越戰區損失了很多貨物，所以堅持要提高價格來彌補損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "可簡妮，我們剩下的資金不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "本艦的補給還是沒有到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "沒......連消息都很久沒收到了。簡妮，你說，倫蒂尼姆那麼動盪，本艦該不會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "維爾，別胡思亂想，你也說了，時局不穩，興許就是什麼事耽擱了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那......接下來要怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我們還是得把病患的需求放在首位，這七箱藥有總比沒有好，價格再高我們也只能認了。其他的......我們能省就省吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "一直省也不是辦法啊......我們地窖裡就剩一點發芽的馬鈴薯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "晚上回去我再想想有沒有其他的辦法，我和希拉女士約好的時間快到了，她家裡的煙囪堵了，我得去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "好，那我先回辦事處了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐，琴柳小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "希拉女士，你怎麼追出來了？你的身體......我還是扶你回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "今天風這麼大，還是進屋子裡來再坐坐吧。你剛從煙囪裡爬出來就要離開，我都沒來得及好好謝謝你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "沒、沒關係，我沒法久留的，辦事處還有病人呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "最近天氣冷，你和維爾的衣服夠穿嗎？我這裡有幾條裙子你們可以拿去穿，舊是舊了些，樣式還是不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "謝謝你的好意了，希拉女士，瓦伊凡是沒那麼容易感冒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "唉，就算不為保暖也是可以穿穿的呀。你身上的衣服都補過好幾次了，也沒見你換過。你可不准走啊，我回屋給你拿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "真、真的不用！我馬上就走了，女士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "（小聲）爸爸，快看，那個姐姐的頭髮好漂亮啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "（小聲）嘖，每天還有閒情逸趣打理頭髮，真是個淑女小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "好了，艾瑪，快別看了，該走了，我們和理髮師約的時間快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "爸爸，我們能不能不去啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "求你了，爸爸，我、我想像那個姐姐一樣，不留那麼長，就到肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "艾瑪，你怎麼能像她一樣！人家是大公司派來的人，不是來這裡過苦日子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我們家呢，你媽媽病著，我得時時照顧，你要是留長髮我哪有時間幫你整理？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "......可是我......我、我真的不想剪寸頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "還不走！你想挨揍嗎，艾瑪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "這位先生，有話好好和孩子說，為什麼要動手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我......那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "（忍不住地啜泣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "唉......小孩調皮，我小小教訓下，就......小小教訓下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "打擾小姐您做事了，真不該......不好意思，不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "好了好了，艾瑪，趕快走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐，我還以為你已經走了呢。這是衣服，還有我家裡剩下的一小袋麵粉，都給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "這不好吧......希拉女士，你食物足夠嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "夠，當然夠，我男人在前線吃軍餉，家裡就我一個人吃飯，肯定夠，你就放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......謝謝、謝謝你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "簡妮，你在這裡待多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "報告長官，兩、兩三個小時？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "你怎麼來這麼早？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "今天是我第一次在廣場上升旗，心裡很激動，昨天一晚上都沒睡著，乾脆早早就來這裡等著了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "哦？你這副模樣可不像一晚上都沒睡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......等天亮的時間裡，總歸還是要找些事情做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "嗯，做得不錯，看著是蠻光彩照人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "謝謝您的誇獎，長官。注意儀容儀表，本就是儀仗兵該做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞駐軍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "text": "好了好了，儀仗兵小姐，太陽要升起來了，去把旗子也升起來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "遵、遵命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "簡妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將被晨風吹亂的髮絲攏至耳後，女孩站起身來，舉起旗幟向廣場中央的旗杆走去。\n隨著旗幟緩緩升起，早早等候在廣場上的民眾開始熱烈地鼓掌。\n掌聲裡，幾聲低語飄進了女孩的耳中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真是不明白，小丘郡這種鎮子也需要派個專門的儀仗兵來升旗嗎？好像這事我們沒法辦似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵，我可不會為了看大老爺們升旗早早從床上爬起來。至少這場面挺賞心悅目的，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要我說，不如送幾沓電影海報來，人手一張，每天掛在牆上欣賞，特別振奮人心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閉嘴吧，別嚷嚷了，就是個儀仗兵，賞心悅目就夠了，你要求那麼多幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將目光投向人群，女孩試圖從中分辨出講話的人。\n但所有人的臉上都洋溢著讚許的笑容，女孩懷疑剛剛的聲音只是幻聽。\n凜冽的晨風突然朝廣場吹來，倒灌進女孩的領口。\n在風中，女孩忍不住打了一個哆嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "起床了！簡妮，起床了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "幾點了......維爾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "才五點，我們六點出門，你還有時間綁個辮子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "算了......今天不綁了，我們直接走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "那個......維爾，你知道鎮子上的理髮師住在哪裡嗎？我打算去剪個頭髮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "什、什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "要......要是沒有的話，我自己剪也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "不、不是......鎮子上當然有理發師，就住在街尾最後一家。但簡妮......這麼好的頭髮，剪掉多可惜啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "留著難免妨礙到工作嘛......那明天下午你可以幫我頂個班嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "怎、怎麼這麼著急？要不再等等？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "你是不想我剪短嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "沒有的事啦，剪短就剪短嘛......幹活更利索，況且你短頭髮肯定也好看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......謝謝你，維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "打擾了，請問現在在營業時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "先生您認識我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "這鎮子上誰不知道您呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您今天怎麼過來了，要保養頭髮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "不、不是的，我是來剪頭髮的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "剪頭髮啊......那坐吧，琴柳小姐，我去拿剪刀。如果您想喝點水，桌上就有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "麻煩了，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您打算剪多短呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "剪得和大家差不多就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "那......我剪了，琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鏡子裡，理髮師抓起了女孩的一撮髮絲夾在指縫中，刀鋒相合，髮絲便從他手中掉落。\n女孩盯著那束落在地上的髮絲，放空了思緒，等待著耳邊的剪刀再響第二聲。\n她等了一會兒，沒有等到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "您怎麼不剪了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐，我們的消息沒有你們那麼靈通，你們來自大公司，能接觸到的管道比我們這樣的平民百姓要多。我想問......想問......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "沒事的，先生，如果您需要幫忙，我肯定會幫您的。您是要打聽什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "是......不、不是的，我就想問問鎮子的情況，你們是不是看到了些不好的勢頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "您怎麼會這麼想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您說呢，琴柳小姐？您都來剪頭髮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "剪、剪個頭髮而已，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐，您不是一直都是這個形象嗎？怎麼現在突然就要剪短了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "就是現在精力和時間都有限，我、我顧不上這些了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "......有事要發生了，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我、我沒有收到那樣的消息，目前來說......一切都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "不......您騙我，琴柳小姐，您就直說吧，是不是那些薩卡茲馬上就要打過來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您是不是覺得大家承受不了真相，所以瞞著大家，不願意說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我沒向大家隱瞞任何事情，先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "那......如果事態沒有變壞，您為什麼要剪頭髮？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "先生......別這麼激動，冷、冷靜些好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您今天突然找上我，讓我剪掉您的頭髮，還要求越短越好，就好像下輩子都不打算在頭髮上花心思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "之前再難的時候，您、您也沒說要剪頭髮啊，怎麼今天就要剪了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "抱歉，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我想我還是抽時間改天再來吧，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "希拉女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐？你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "沒什麼，我來就是想剪個頭髮，最近工作忙，抽不出時間打理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "欸......希拉女士，你今天是塗了口紅嗎？怪不得看著氣色好多了，這顏色挺適合你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聽到琴柳的誇讚，女人卻並沒有露出喜色，反而倉惶地用手蹭去了唇上的緋紅。\n隨後她又捏起衣角，擦拭起手背上殘留的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女人的力氣很大，手背上的皮膚都被擦紅了，也沒能將上面的顏色擦拭乾淨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "希拉女士，你、你這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "也是我糊塗，都什麼時候了，怎麼還把那支口紅拿出來塗，連琴柳小姐你這樣體面過日子的人都沒心思了......唉，真不該。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憔悴的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "那個......琴柳小姐，你趕快去忙吧，我、我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "希拉女士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯？簡妮，你沒有剪頭髮嗎？我還在期待你的新髮型呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我、我和理髮師重新約了時間，過幾天再去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "幸好你沒有剪，不然就沒法戴這個了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "紙花？你折的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我哪有那麼巧的手，是一個小女孩送來的，說希望你能喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "真漂亮，用軟綿綿的紙巾折花，真是難為她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "你不戴上試試嗎？配你的長髮應該很適合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "我......之後就要剪掉了......這不是浪費人家的心意嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "那不是幾天後的事情嗎？不耽誤現在，戴上嘛......你就戴上試試嘛，你看這花折得多好，就像真花一樣漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將那朵紙花湊到鼻尖輕輕嗅聞，女孩的眼神中露出了一絲陶醉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "嗯......我好像能從上面聞到鮮花的香味......淡淡的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "維爾......那不是真的花，再像也不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我知道的嘛，可快到冬天了，離春天又還遠，現在也沒有真的花啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "賞花留到春天再做也可以啊，冬天有冬天要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "可我們在冬天做了那麼一大堆事，不都是為了等待下個春天的到來嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "在一個漫長的冬天裡，就算只是朵小小的紙花，也能提醒大家春天會如約而至。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "如果沒有那朵紙花呢......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "我也不知道啊，簡妮......紙花就是個盼頭，無論大家有沒有盼頭，春天都會來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "可是，維爾，人們期盼一樣東西，不僅是想讓它來到自己身邊，更是想讓它來到自己心裡吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "或許一個人不會永遠活在冬天，但一個人的心會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "是......沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......把那朵花給我吧......維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "text": "哦......好、好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "摸了摸紙花柔軟的花瓣，琴柳用指尖捏住紙花，轉了幾圈，然後戴在了耳邊，又似乎是因為羞澀，輕輕低下頭。\n無言半晌，最終她抬起頭，看向同事的眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "你覺得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "呼......冷死了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "琴柳小姐，早、早安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "早、早安，小妹妹你......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "你頭上的花是我昨天折的......你今天戴著，我、我非常高興......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "......噢，這朵花是你送的嗎？謝謝，折得很漂亮，我很喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "那就太好啦......琴柳小姐，我、我能摸摸你的頭髮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "當然、當然可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "你的頭髮真的好漂亮啊，媽媽以前也和你一樣，頭髮長長的，可生病後就剪掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "等她病好了，一定還會把頭髮再留起來的，到時候一定會比我的頭髮還漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "唉，那也是很遠很遠以後的事情了，媽媽的病......一直都不見好......爸爸最近很難過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "別擔心，說不定到明年開春就能有起色了。到時候，你可以帶著她去公園裡折些真正的花，配她的長髮一定很適合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "人的頭髮哪裡會長那麼快啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "沒關係，到時候我和你們一起去，我可以把頭髮借給她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "借？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "琴柳撩起自己的長髮，披在女孩的腦袋上，濃密的金色發絲將女孩整個人都包裹在裡面。\n而那束在女孩手裡的髮絲被她攥緊，又鬆開。\n意識到女孩在緊張，琴柳將紙花從鬢邊摘下，戴在了女孩的耳旁。\n一瞬間，女孩的臉漲紅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "好、好看嗎，琴柳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "好看，非常好看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "艾瑪，我幫你爸爸剪完了，到你來剪了......欸，琴柳小姐......你們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "哎......爸爸，你來啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看到父親從門後出現，女孩慌張地將琴柳的頭髮從腦袋上撥開，而那朵掛在她耳朵上的白花也被她急匆匆的動作掃落在地。\n但出乎意料的是，她的父親只是輕輕摸了摸她的臉頰，然後將花撿起，塞回了她的手心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "等久了吧，冷不冷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "不久，也不冷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "早安，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "早安，琴柳小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "那個......琴柳小姐......我這幾天暫時還沒有時間，您剪頭髮的事......可能還要再等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "啊，琴柳小姐......你、你要剪頭髮嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "您不剪了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "琴柳",
      "speakerId": "avg_479_sleach_1",
      "text": "對，我改變主意了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "理髮師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_417_1",
      "text": "那艾瑪呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瘦小的女孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_700_1",
      "text": "爸爸......我、我能不剪嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "清瘦的男性",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣風從長街穿過，琴柳將被吹亂的髮絲撥回耳後，看向了男人。\n女孩攥緊了手裡的紙花，理髮師用腳尖蹭了蹭門框。\n在所有人期待的目光中，男人喉頭一動，終於張口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
